    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39914" root="نصر" body-key="n">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنصر</span></b>  <i>He asked, sought,</i> or <i>desired, aid,</i>
or <i>assistance.</i> (M, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنصره</span> <i>He asked
him to aid him,</i> (S, Msb, K,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>against him,</i>
(S, K,) i. e. against his enemy. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
(tropical:)  <i>He begged;</i> (K;) as though he asked for a
gift, which is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصْر</span>. (TA.)

